Third-party tools downloaded at runtime
---------------------------------------

The following tools are NOT included in or redistributed with this
repository or the npm package. They are downloaded from their official
release locations by `complies-with-eu init` (into
~/.complies-with-eu/tools or the configured tools directory). They remain
subject to their own licenses:

* HL7 FHIR Validator (validator_cli.jar)
  https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

* fhir-pkg-tool by Gefyra GmbH
  https://github.com/Gefyra/fhir-pkg-tool
  Licensed under the MIT License.

FHIR packages
-------------

FHIR Implementation Guide packages (for example the HL7 Europe packages
hl7.fhir.eu.* and any package you validate) are downloaded from FHIR
package registries at runtime. They are not part of
this project and remain subject to their own licenses and terms of use.
